{"availability":"available","full":"mukulsinghal001/customer-lifetime-prediction-using-python","name":"customer-lifetime-prediction-using-python","description":"What is CLV or LTV? CLV or LTV is a metric that helps you measure the customer's lifetime value to a business. In this kernel, I am sharing the customer lifetime value prediction using BG-NBD, Pareto, NBD & Gamma Model on top of RFM in Python.","category":"Business","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":169,"forks":60,"created":"2020-11-18T07:46:03Z","updated":"2022-12-04T14:12:13Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mukulsinghal001-customer-lifetime-model-de-streamlit-app-t3zaq6.streamlit.app/","topics":["bg-nbd","clv","customer-analytics","customer-lifetime","customer-lifetime-value","customer-segmentation","data-analysis","e-commerce","e-commerce-project","ecommerce","ltv","machine-learning","marketing-analytics","python"],"demo":"https://mukulsinghal001-customer-lifetime-model-de-streamlit-app-t3zaq6.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:53.758Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:53.758Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T04:15:53.758Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T13:35:12.797Z","stars":169,"forks":60},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:33:52.390Z","stars":169,"forks":60},{"at":"2026-10-12T19:07:03.438Z","stars":169,"forks":60},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:15:53.758Z","stars":169,"forks":60}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["We have to predict the customer's lifetime value and segment the customers based on their LTV so that we can provide this information to the marketing team for the campaign & CPA optimization.","The dataset which we are going to use in this problem has taken from the UCI Machine Learning Repository. This is a transactional data set which contains all the actual transactions for a UK-based and registered ecommerce online retail store. The company mainly sells unique all-occasion gifts. This dataset has several featu